My name is Mr. Lock.{VAR BE01}
I'm a magical clown who can
open anything.{VAR BE01}
Your name is {VAR 0100 0000}.
I'll see you again, I'm sure.

You have a Lock Capsule in your Bag...{VAR BE01}
I am the only one in the whole world
who can open the capsule.{VAR BE01}
I can open it in the blink of an eye!{VAR BE01}

Look! As you can see, I opened it swiftly
and with precision!{VAR BE01}
Inside the capsule...
What your heart most desires...{VAR BE00}
a Technical Machine!{VAR BE01}

“I entrust the Technical Machine in the
Lock Capsule to a trustworthy Trainer in{VAR BE00}
the Unova region.{VAR BE01}
Don't allow it to fall into the hands of
villains like Team Rocket..."{VAR BE01}

More is written here...{VAR BE01}
“TM95 is Snarl.
It's a Dark-type Special Attack, and{VAR BE00}
it lowers the opponents' Sp. Atk stat."{VAR BE01}
So that's what it is...a move that tests
the sense of the user!

Even though I opened the Lock Capsule,
I can't unlock a closed heart.{VAR BE01}
I am a sad clown, indeed...

I secretly invented a special machine.{VAR BE01}
Only people who know the secret
password can use it.{VAR BE01}

This is the password that will enable you
to use the Relocator I invented!{VAR BE01}
It's a superb machine that will swiftly
fetch a special Pokémon or item{VAR BE00}
by connecting to a special network.

I added a button on the main menu.{VAR BE01}
Please save the game, then go back to
the title screen!
